# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# Except this one, deliberately. It is the standard Android debug keystore and it
# signs nothing that ships; checking it in is what makes the signing-cert SHA-256
# the same everywhere, which App Link verification requires. See
# app/build.gradle.kts.
!app/debug.keystore
